WEBVTT

00:00:00.709 --> 00:00:04.627
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> According to a new survey of two thousand British adults,

00:00:04.929 --> 00:00:10.500
most people are incredibly impatient in nearly every aspect of their lives.

00:00:11.362 --> 00:00:17.197
People get frustrated after twenty-five seconds of waiting for a traffic light to change.

00:00:18.145 --> 00:00:23.065
Just over a third of people become impatient while trying to take notes

00:00:23.166 --> 00:00:26.622
and follow a speaker during a class or work meeting.

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:31.065
Forty-five percent of people admit they lose their temper

00:00:31.066 --> 00:00:35.034
after waiting for thirty seconds in a queue that isn’t moving.